==== OEM easy installation ====

Apply factory image via stock web-gui or use JBOOT recovery service.

==== JBOOT recovery service ====
  - Push the reset button and turn on the power. Wait until LED start blinking (~10sec.)
  - Upload original factory image via JBOOT http (IP: 192.168.123.254)
  - If http doesn't work, it can be done with curl command: <code>curl -F FN=@XXXXX.bin http://192.168.123.254/upg</code>  where ''XXXXX.bin'' is name of firmware file.

//someone reported that the device's recovery IP is 192.168.0.1 instead, if the above does not work, try with this IP too//

