| Power/Status    | Green  | 14  | Active High  | ?   | ?    | Power Symbol    |
| Battery Status  | Red    | N/A | N/A          | N/A | N/A  | Battery Symbol  |
| Battery Status  | Green  | N/A | N/A          | N/A | N/A  | Battery Symbol  |


